    "title": "Zeam",
    "description": "Welcome to Zeam \u2013 your ultimate live, local entertainment companion. Zeam ensures you stay informed about everything happening around you, with immediate access to breaking news, authentic reporting that resonates with where you're at, where you're from, and where you're going. Zeam is your go-to source for live, local TV. Zeam offers on-demand news clips, live event coverage, and more. The Zeam experience is here to make you feel connected, informed, and entertained \u2013 anytime, anywhere. Download now and embark on a journey of discovery with Zeam!",
